oujSY2-tdV0oZoViZg1ctf2TfuyZ2jVQ41TFYQmeUrmK3UjuR_7Ypm8rgLuy7mQ9Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTT7Mzx26SwBdNE-DlFw0z8MHnroAIAWQ7nRCGgiALfqA&oe=6B0863DF"}, "display_name": "Ozythra", "keywords": ["mixedreality", "storytelling", "nature", "scifi", "ozythra"], "long_description": "Ozythra is a cinematic mixed-reality storytelling experience designed for calm exploration and wonder. It blends nature-inspired visuals with subtle science-fiction elements to create living narratives that unfold directly in your physical environment.\n\nEach experience in Ozythra is crafted as a self-contained story, with more stories and worlds planned over time. The focus is on mood, presence, and emotional resonance\u2014designed to feel cinematic, poetic, and immersive.\n\nKey Features:\n1) Mixed-reality storytelling that blends seamlessly with your real environment.\n2) Hands-only interaction using natural gestures.\n3) Calm, cinematic visuals and sound design.\n4) Narrative-driven experiences focused on atmosphere and meaning.\n5) Designed for relaxed, mindful exploration\n\nUse in a safe, clear space and remain aware of your surroundings. Ozythra is best experienced at your own pace, allowing the story to unfold naturally around you.", "short_description": "Ozythra is a mixed-reality storytelling experience where nature and science gently intertwine. Explore poetic, hands-only interactions that unfold living stories in your real space."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.xtrofttech.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Xtroft Tech Limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.xtrofttech.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": 